From d9d9dd11e62216d6560165a4adcd24e01b56e6fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:22:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): regenerate i18n keys for kanbanStalled;
 pre-commit keeps them in sync [daveey]

Main CI run 40615214781 (068660dc1c) failed JS & TS checks:
locales/_keys.desktop.json is out of date with src/i18n/en.ts.

Why 1: the keys file lacks sidebar.row.kanbanStalled.
Why 2: 6b8dbae580 added that string to en.ts without running `npm run i18n:keys`.
Why 3: nothing regenerates the file at commit time; only CI's
  scripts/i18n-keys.test.mjs compares it, after the commit is on main.
Fix: regenerate the file, and add a lefthook pre-commit job that runs
i18n:keys and stages the result whenever apps/desktop/src/i18n/en*.ts is staged.
Verified: with the stale file restored, `lefthook run pre-commit --job "desktop i18n keys"`
rewrote and staged it; scripts/i18n-keys.test.mjs passes (2/2).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 lefthook.yml               | 5 +++++
 locales/_keys.desktop.json | 1 +
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/lefthook.yml b/lefthook.yml
index 885d0e13b2..987ee63009 100644
--- a/lefthook.yml
+++ b/lefthook.yml
@@ -19,6 +19,11 @@ pre-commit:
       glob: "*.{js,ts,tsx}"
       run: npx eslint {staged_files}
 
+    # CI fails when locales/_keys.desktop.json lags the English strings; regenerate on commit.
+    - name: desktop i18n keys
+      glob: "apps/desktop/src/i18n/en*.ts"
+      run: npm --prefix apps/desktop run -s i18n:keys && git add locales/_keys.desktop.json
+
     - name: lint tui
       root: ui-tui/
       glob: "*.{js,ts,tsx}"
diff --git a/locales/_keys.desktop.json b/locales/_keys.desktop.json
index 5f58b7d08f..2bff93cf71 100644
--- a/locales/_keys.desktop.json
+++ b/locales/_keys.desktop.json
@@ -4423,6 +4423,7 @@
     "sidebar.row.handoffOrigin",
     "sidebar.row.hideTabBar",
     "sidebar.row.kanbanAttention",
+    "sidebar.row.kanbanStalled",
     "sidebar.row.kanbanTasks",
     "sidebar.row.markRead",
     "sidebar.row.markUnread",
-- 
2.55.0

